{"d":"<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">Mūsdienīgs jumta segums. Galvenās materiāla īpatnības &ndash; spēja nodro&scaron;ināt simtprocentīgu jumta hermetizāciju, iespēja uzstādīt bez īpa&scaron;as tehnikas. Pla&scaron;a krāsu un piegriezumu daudzveidība. Piemērots jebkuras sarežģītības slīpo jumtu seguma ieklā&scaron;anai.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<!--<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=TOP\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kolekcija TOP</span></span></a></h1>--->\r\n<div><!--<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Shinglas TOP&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">- Premium klases divslāņu laminēie bitumena dakstiņi ar uzlabotām īpa&scaron;ībām. TOP sastāv&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">no neaustā stiklaudekla pamatnes, kur&scaron; no abām pusēm ir pārklāts ar aukstas kvalitātes bitumenu.</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;Kā aizsargslānis tiek izmantots krāsains rupjgraudains bazalta pārklājums, kas aizsargā materiālu no saules staru iedarbības un pagarina kalpo&scaron;anas laiku. Pateicoties daudzslāņainai uzbūvei, Jazz piemīt&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">paaugstināta izturība un ilgmūžīgums, augstas hidroizolācijas īpa&scaron;ības un noturība pret vēju</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Pla&scaron;ais pārklājuma krāsu salikums, padara materiālu estētiski izteiksmīgu, bet jumta klājuma reljefs&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">imitē jumta segumu no dabīgiem materiāliem.</span>&nbsp;Pateicoties minerālo granulu vienmērīgam krāsojumam<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">&nbsp;TOP</span>&nbsp;dakstiņu pārklājuma tonis ir ļoti noturīgs, kas nodro&scaron;ina lielisku jumta izskatu ilgu laiku.</span></p>--->\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=ULTRA\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\">Kolekcija ULTRA</span></span></a></h1>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">SHINGLAS ULTRA&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">&ndash; bitumena jumta dakstiņi, kas pieejami dažādās krāsās un formās.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Bitumena dakstiņi&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">SHINGLAS ULTRA&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">at&scaron;ķirībā no pārējiem bitumena dakstiņiem tiek izgatavots no polimēr-modificēta bitumena, kas uzlabo dakstiņu elastību un izturību.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Pieejams pla&scaron;a bitumena dakstiņu krāsu un piegriezuma gamma.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">Ilgmūžības garantija 25 gadi.</span></span></p>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=CLASSIC\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kolekcija CLASSIC</span></span></a></h1>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Pateicoties augststai kvalitātei un pieejamai cenai&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">SHINGLAS CLASSIC&nbsp;</span>bitumena dakstiņi ir iemantoju&scaron;i popularitāti Latvijas tirgū. Shinglas CLASSIC pla&scaron;ais formu un krāsu klāsts nodro&scaron;ina ikvienam būvētājm iespējas izvēlēties tie&scaron;i viņam vispiemērotāko dakstiņu toni un piegriezumu.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Ilgmūžības garantija 15 gadi.</span></span></p>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=STANDARD+ROCK\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\">Kolekcija STANDARD</span></span></a></h1>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-size: small;\">Bitumena dakstiņu&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">STANDARD</span>&nbsp;ir lieliski piemēroti ēkām, kur galvenie priek&scaron;noteikumi jumta seguma izvēlē ir dro&scaron;ība, ekonomiskums un jumta izskats.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-size: small;\">Ilgmūžības garantija 10 gadi.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><br><br>","t":{"ACCORD":"<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"0\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\"> <img width=\"182\" height=\"134\" style=\"width: 152px; height: 123px;\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/acord_shem.gif\"/></td>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n            <p><strong> ACCORD JIVE</strong> - modificētā bitumena elastīgie dakstiņi</p>\r\n            <p><strong>ACCORD PRAGUE</strong> - oksidētā bitumena dakstiņi</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"right\"> <img width=\"116\" height=\"68\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/acord_dakst.gif\"/></td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>","TANGO":"<table cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"95%\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td> <img height=\"154\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/tango_shem.gif\" width=\"187\"/></td>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n            <p> TANGO SUPER - oksidēta bitumena dakstiņi.</p>\r\n            <p>Taisnstūris ar pašlīmējošu pamatni.</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"right\"> <img height=\"99\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/tango.gif\" width=\"183\"/></td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>","SONATA":"<table cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td> <img height=\"144\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/sonata_shem.gif\" width=\"188\" alt=\"\"/></td>\r\n            <td valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\">\r\n            <p>SONATA SAMBA -  modificētā bitumena elastīgie dakstiņi</p>\r\n            <p> </p>\r\n            <p> </p>\r\n            <p>SONATA VERSALLES - oksidētā bitumena dakstiņi</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"middle\" align=\"right\" width=\"120\">\r\n            <p> <img height=\"61\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/sonata_samba(1).gif\" width=\"116\"/></p>\r\n            <p> </p>\r\n            <p><img height=\"61\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/sonata_versalles.gif\" width=\"116\"/></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td width=\"225\"> </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">SONATA QUADRILLE -  oksidētā bitumena dakstiņi</td>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"right\" width=\"120\"> <img height=\"65\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/sonata_kadril.gif\" width=\"116\"/></td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p> </p>","TRIO":"<table cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"95%\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\"> <img height=\"156\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/trio_shem.gif\" width=\"190\" alt=\"\"/></td>\r\n            <td valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\">\r\n            <p> TRIO SUPER - oksidētā bitumena dakstiņi.</p>\r\n            <p>Taisnstūris ar pašlīmējošu pamatni.</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" align=\"right\"><img height=\"110\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/trio.gif\" width=\"183\" alt=\"\"/> </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>","HEXAGONAL":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/tehnonic/Hexagonal_sh.jpg\"><img width=\"150\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"150\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/tehnonic/Hexagonal_sh.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a>Tehnonicol Hexagonal ir jaunas paaudzes jumta segumu materiāls slīpņu jumtam ar novirzienu no  11,3 grādiem līdz 90 grādiem. Tas ir kvalitatīvs produkts. Pateicoties  tipu un krāsu daudzveidībai bitumenu jumta segums saformē un papildina  arhitektūras lēmumus, kas ir izstrādāti at&scaron;ķirīgājos stilistiskās  veidos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Tehniskie dati:<br />\r\n</strong>Svars - 8,7 kg/m2<br />\r\nIepakojums - 3 m2<br />\r\nDaudzums uz paletes - 135 m2</p>","3 Tab":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/tehnonic/3tab.png\" width=\"158\" height=\"60\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/jumti/tehnonic/3-tab_4tab-green.jpg\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />Bitumena dakstiņu&nbsp;<strong>STANDARD&nbsp;</strong>ir lieliski piemēroti ēkām, kur galvenie priek&scaron;noteikumi jumta seguma izvēlē ir dro&scaron;ība, ekonomiskums un jumta izskats.&nbsp;Ilgmūžības garantija 10 gadi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}}